    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d85">

                <pb facs="0159" n="993" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg993"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/10403</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The French High Commissioner</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Tardieu</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Assistant
                        to the Counselor for the Department of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Auchincloss</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 29891</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 31, 1918</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Counselor</hi>: Confirming my
                    conversation with you, of August 29, I beg to state that I have been instructed
                    by my Government to ascertain whether the American Government would be willing
                    to appoint a representative to an inter-Allied blockade committee to be
                    constituted in Paris for the discussion of economic questions relating to Spain
                    and Switzerland.</p>
                <p>This proposed committee would be on the same lines as the one at present existing
                    in London for northern European neutrals.</p>
                <pb facs="0160" n="994" xml:id="pg994"/>
                <p>My Government is of opinion that such an organization would materially strengthen
                    and coordinate inter-Allied blockade action in Spain and Switzerland.</p>
                <p>Believe me [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the High Commissioner: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Billy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
